  "_comment2": "cleanUrl: 两端仅保证『规范小写 host + 无特殊编码』一致域等价(Web=WHATWG URL 规范化,exe=字符串级近似,差异域:大写 host/空 path 补斜杠/%20→+/空格→+ —— exe 有意不做重编码,非规则漂移)。fixtures 只覆盖一致域,输入不含需编码字符。",
  "cleanUrl": [
    { "name": "no-query", "input": "https://example.com/path", "expect": "https://example.com/path" },
    { "name": "no-tracking-param", "input": "https://example.com/path?a=1&b=2", "expect": "https://example.com/path?a=1&b=2" },
    { "name": "single-utm-source", "input": "https://example.com/path?utm_source=x&a=1", "expect": "https://example.com/path?a=1" },
