  "_comment3": "expiry: isExpired 输入用远离时钟的定值(0/极小/极久远),避免 Date.now 竞态;expireAt=0 守卫是 2026-09-03 差分门禁抓出的 exe 单边 bug 回归用例(Web !!c.expireAt → 0=永久)。resolveExpire 本应差分,但两端内部取当前时钟(Date.now/UtcNow),逐值对拍会因毫秒级时差失败——故只测 IsExpired 判定(规则实体),resolveExpire 属解析器已有各自单测覆盖。",
  "expiry": [
    { "name": "null-permanent", "clip": { "id": "c1" }, "expect": false },
    { "name": "zero-permanent", "clip": { "id": "c1", "expireAt": 0 }, "expect": false },
    { "name": "tiny-past-expired", "clip": { "id": "c1", "expireAt": 1 }, "expect": true },
    { "name": "far-future-active", "clip": { "id": "c1", "expireAt": 4102444800000 }, "expect": false },
    { "name": "boundary-now-minus-large", "clip": { "id": "c1", "expireAt": 1000000000000 }, "expect": true }
